{"id": "EUVD-2026-93330", "enisaUuid": "cd6a05cd-c757-37a1-96f6-c77bddfe2d1a", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: cfg80211: check IP header size in cfg80211_classify8021d()\n\nA frame that looks like IP can be transmitted, but be too short, so\nthe DS field is read incorrectly:\n\n  BUG: KMSAN: uninit-value in cfg80211_classify8021d+0x99d/0x12b0 net/wireless/util.c:1027\n   cfg80211_classify8021d+0x99d/0x12b0 net/wireless/util.c:1027\n   ieee80211_select_queue+0x37a/0x9e0 net/mac80211/wme.c:180\n   __ieee80211_subif_start_xmit+0x60f/0x1d90 net/mac80211/tx.c:4304\n   ieee80211_subif_start_xmit+0xa8/0x6d0 net/mac80211/tx.c:4538\n   ...\n   packet_sendmsg+0x9173/0xa2a0 net/packet/af_packet.c:3108\n\nUse skb_header_pointer() like the MPLS case.", "datePublished": "2026-10-06T08:46:34", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:17:56", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/18d5547327c202cda33ad2bbd203220c2c62c8a7", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3ff17ffa8d02e0e3f6b2f6e57af4aac511f5b734", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c4fbcf1e614ef0755fcc751fdfca21b0bf4e0ef7", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/12c0abd4d1c1b04a7663d04ba85268bc9ad9c017", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f33ad4e2f846e55cf4637419268f093ac9f1a765", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a2cdb4a675ca04c4ac8cc962848082d8ce065008", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/65893c8d28f239c7ddad5a83683be193a9133e9b", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/48b2c5c628b09cf36cbeca53e0432fc2a7518be7"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98345", "GHSA-vm8v-8wgx-pm6r"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "086396ac-050e-3732-9790-cc5149938b1c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "e31a16d6f64ef0e324c6f54d5112703c3f13a9c4 <65893c8d28f239c7ddad5a83683be193a9133e9b"}, {"id": "0a634e76-586e-3f27-8e65-f0c1953934f0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 5.15.222"}, {"id